  "prefLabel": "He-C 6914.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6914.02 Scope. This part shall apply to licensed and license-exempt child care providers who receive financial reimbursement from the department for those families utilizing employment related, preventive, or protective child care services.\n\nSource. #12223, eff 7-10-17; ss by #13065, eff 7-1-20; ss by #14095, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-9-24; ss by #14222, eff 3-27-25, EXPIRES: 3-27-35",
